   "text": "Ospreys that breed around the Chesapeake Bay head south each autumn, and many winter in northern South America, including the Amazon basin. They return in spring to the same bay.",
   "imgwiki": "Osprey",
   "when": "Leave the bay in autumn and return in spring.",
   "matters": "Ospreys need fish at the bay and on their winter rivers. Harm to either end hurts the same birds.",
